ed to be the gomu gomu no me is  actually a mythical zone devil fruit  called the hitohito nomi or human human  fruit mythical model nica not only that  but the gorosei are aware of this  legendary fruit they considered to be  extremely dangerous a direct threat to  their power and they have been trying to  get their hands on it for a very long  time they almost succeeded in capturing  it but then shanks took it luffy ate it  and all of their plans fell through in  fact it is said that zone devil fruits  have a mind of their own and it is as if  the legendary nika devil fruit has been  consciously running away from the  gorosei this is of course a massive  revelation because the one piece fandom  has been speculating for a very long  time that devil fruits may be alive each  devil fruit may have its own will maybe  even its own consciousness and this will  and consciousness may belong to a  previous user or users of that specific  devil fruit  after all if the devil fruits themselves  can be reincarnated after their user  dies who's to say that some part of the  user like their will or consciousness  cannot also be reincarnated along with  the fruit something like this has been  hinted at for a very long time after  sabo consumes ace's former devil fruit  the mera meranomi it is implied that he  inherited more than just aces power  there seems to be something of aces  still within the fruit and sabo has  inherited that as well we don't know  what exactly this something is is it  ace's spiritual presence ace's will  ace's personality and so on but there  does seem to be something there then we  have the example of an animated object  such as a gun or a sword eating devil  fruits now obviously when a human or  other sentient creature eats a devil  fruit they will continue to function as  sentient beings with their own  personality because that's how they were  before eating the fruit but since most  inanimate objects don't have a  personality a will or in essence certain  special swords accepted then the fact  that these inanimate object devil fruits  are able to function as sentient living  beings means that the ability to  function as a sentient being comes from  the devil fruits themselves there is  some sort of sentience some sort of will  or presence within devil fruits that  allows even inanimate objects to become  sentient upon consuming a devil fruit to  be fair all known examples of inanimate  objects consuming devil fruits come from  zone devil fruits but now that we know  that luffy's devil fruit is actually a  mythical zone the argument still stands  devil fruits and especially zone devil  fruits have a will or presence of their  own and while this presence may be  dormant most of the time that is clearly  no longer the case for luffy with the  awakening of his devil fruit something  else has awoken inside of him a separate  essence that zunesha straight up refers  to as joy boy himself so what is this  essence exactly and how will it affect  luffy one possible scenario is a very  controversial one and that is the  possibility that luffy himself is the  literal reincarnation of joy boy a  historical figure who lived during the  void century this means that joy boy  isn't necessarily inside the devil fruit  he is actually inside of luffy but the  devil fruit somehow triggered his  awakening perhaps this nika devil fruit  with a will of its own has been  searching for the reincarnation of its  former user joyboy and it eventually  found that reincarnation  in monkey d luffy now this possibility  has been widely criticized by many  members of the community because they  believe that reincarnation is just a  cheap literary trope and it constitutes  bad writing if luffy is a reincarnation  then he won't be his own unique person  with his own unique will and destiny and  that cheapens his entire character arc  while i don't necessarily want luffy to  be a literal reincarnation of joy boy i  have to say that people criticizing this  possibility don't seem to have a proper  understanding of how reincarnation works  especially in buddhism and of course  buddhism has been a huge influence on  oda and it has been referenced many  times in the story i don't want to get  too deep into buddhist beliefs in this  video but it is important to stress that  for people who believe in reincarnation  like buddhists hindus and others  reincarnation is not just a cheap trope  it is a widely accepted reality  something it just is and something that  goes without saying just as you might  accept that all people who live will  eventually die someone who believes in  reincarnation accepts that all people  who one day die will also be  reincarnated there is a lot more there  including the concepts of karma samsara  nirvana and so on but the important  point is this the way that reincarnation  is understood in japan is not the way  that it is understood in the west it is  not just a lazy literary trope it is far  deeper far more complex and far more  culturally and spiritually rooted okay  now having said that what happens if  luffy really is a reincarnation of joy  boy and his awakening suddenly triggers  his memories of that previous life  presumably luffy would suddenly become  aware of everything that the original  joyboy was aware of all of his life  experiences would suddenly also become  luffy's life experiences not only would  this potentially change luffy as a  person but it would also fundamentally  change the story for the worse i mean  think about it if luffy remembered his  previous life as joy boy he would  suddenly gain knowledge about the void  century he would suddenly know  everything about laughtale in one piece  and all the mysteries of the world would  be solved in an instant in the past  luffy outright refused to be told the  secrets of the world because he wanted  to unlock those secrets himself during  his journey to become the pirate king  and this is why i don't think that luffy  w